"[EHL-COLD-CHAIN-DEV-003] Voiding deviation %(name)s requires a justification"
" in the resolution notes."
msgstr ""
"[EHL-COLD-CHAIN-DEV-003] Het ongeldig maken van afwijking %(name)s vereist "
"een rechtvaardiging in de oplossingsnotities."

#. module: eh_log_cold_chain
